# Mac preview DMG: Gatekeeper copy-paste for testers

When you finish or document a **new unsigned Mac preview** (DMG from `package-dmg.sh` / `release.sh`, GitHub Release, or edits to `MACOS_DMG_PREVIEW_RELEASE.md`), **always** give testers the quarantine removal commands (same as [help/mac-native-app.md](help/mac-native-app.md)).

Paste this block in release notes, chat, or PR description when relevant:

```bash
# After dragging Harvous.app to Applications — unsigned preview / quarantine
xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/Harvous.app
# or, to clear all extended attributes on the app bundle:
xattr -cr /Applications/Harvous.app
```

Remind testers to try **Control-click → Open** and **Privacy & Security → Open Anyway** first; do **not** suggest disabling Gatekeeper globally. Link `help/mac-native-app.md` for full steps.
